build/

# `makeTestIndex` names an index after the test that built it. The tests pass a
# basename under a temporary directory so that nothing lands here, but a run
# from an older build, or a stray `makeTestIndex(turtle)` without a basename,
# still writes to the working directory. Ignored so that a `git add -A` after
# running the tests cannot commit 144 files of index again.
Continuation_*
*.index.*
*.meta-data.json
*.vocabulary*
